[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 23762.628, "timestamp": "06:36:02", "text": "他们似乎添加了一项新活动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23766.31, "timestamp": "06:36:06", "text": "我当时想：“哦，免费的皮肤。” 但是不，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23774.628, "timestamp": "06:36:14", "text": "。 展示漂亮的人物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23783.51, "timestamp": "06:36:23", "text": "这种挤压是不正常的。 佛陀说："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23787.67, "timestamp": "06:36:27", "text": "好吧，我还有多少天时间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23796.07, "timestamp": "06:36:36", "text": "哦，没有时间限制。 哦，不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23800.39, "timestamp": "06:36:40", "text": "是的，他们甚至还有等级通行证。 是的。   真是太"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23807.83, "timestamp": "06:36:47", "text": "疯狂的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23816.948, "timestamp": "06:36:56", "text": "输出型近战战斗。 哦，谢谢你的"}]